  Per-list content-limit overrides for UxrContentLimiterImpl. Root is Mapping; children are
  ListConfig. Deliberately empty of overrides: with no entry for a2ui_list the limiter falls back to
  CarUxRestrictions.getMaxCumulativeContentItems(), the vehicle's own number, which is the case
  worth demonstrating. An override here would show this app's opinion rather than the platform's.

  NOTE: this comment block may be load-bearing. CarUxRestrictionsAppConfigParser opens with two bare
  parser.next() calls, annotated "skip over the xml version tag" and "skip over the copyright comment
  block", before it requires the root element — so the number of parser events preceding Mapping is
  effectively part of the file format. Whether aapt2 preserves comments in compiled XML decides
  whether that holds; verified on device rather than assumed. See README.md.
